1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,629
We left a suburb, passed the outskirts of town and reached a rural road.

2
00:00:04,579 --> 00:00:08,681
A remote house stood in a desolate field, below a distant cliff.

3
00:00:08,681 --> 00:00:11,363
Adjacent to it was an old workshop.

4
00:00:11,363 --> 00:00:15,159
At the border of the field, a broken metal plate covered a pipe.

5
00:00:15,159 --> 00:00:18,170
Along the fringe of the grass lay clay and dirt.

6
00:00:18,170 --> 00:00:21,579
Muddy water carried silt and sediment toward the stream.

7
00:00:21,579 --> 00:00:24,477
Mira drew the pipe in the margin of our map.

8
00:00:24,477 --> 00:00:28,045
A lesson in geology had become a search for evidence.

